/target
.idea
tmp
bin/
*.test

# A bare `go build ./cmd/smyklot` drops the binary here, named after the directory.
# Anchored, so it cannot match charts/smyklot or cmd/smyklot.
/smyklot

# Built from the panel frontend and embedded into the Go binary. Keeping this
# generated archive out of Git prevents every frontend change from conflicting
# on the same binary file.
internal/panelassets/generated/bundle.zip

# The dev mock server keeps your panel preferences here so a restart does not reset them.
internal/panel/frontend/dev/.mock-preferences.json

# Guard against a probe script writing screenshots here when its output path is unset.
internal/panel/frontend/undefined/

# Vitest writes a cache here when it is run from the repo root rather than the frontend.
# No trailing slash: that would match directories only, and a symlinked node_modules is a
# symlink as far as git is concerned, not a directory.
node_modules

# And SvelteKit generates its client here for the same reason: a vite or vitest run
# rooted at the repository rather than at the frontend. Two hundred and sixty generated
# files landed in a commit once already.
.svelte-kit/
